---
/* Simplified architecture of the Zoom Lens prototype, from the project description. */
---

<figure class="arch">
  <div class="grid" role="img" aria-label="Diagram: each participant's Zoom Apps panel sends a request to a Python server, which holds session-scoped requests and recipient rules. The screen, currently captured from the participant's display, is sent with the request to Claude. The answer is routed back to the requesting session only.">
    <div class="node panel" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="k">Client</span>
      <b>Zoom Apps panel</b>
      <span>One per participant. Describe, Explain, Follow-up.</span>
    </div>
    <span class="arrow a1" aria-hidden="true">request →</span>
    <div class="node server" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="k">Server · Python</span>
      <b>Request pipeline</b>
      <span>Session-scoped requests. One recipient per message, no broadcast, replies must match a request.</span>
    </div>
    <span class="arrow a2" aria-hidden="true">screen + task →</span>
    <div class="node model" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="k">Model</span>
      <b>Claude</b>
      <span>Generates the answer for the chosen action.</span>
    </div>
    <div class="node source" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="k">Screen source</span>
      <b>Now: participant’s display</b>
      <span>Planned: direct meeting feed, which needs a capability not yet enabled on the account.</span>
    </div>
    <p class="return" aria-hidden="true">← answer to the requesting session only</p>
  </div>
  <figcaption><span>Diagram.</span> Simplified architecture of the prototype. Not a screenshot.</figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .arch {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-2);
    padding: var(--space-4);
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: var(--border-hairline);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  }

  @media (min-width: 56rem) {
    .grid {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto minmax(0, 1.2fr) auto minmax(0, 1fr);
      align-items: stretch;
      gap: var(--space-3);
    }

    .source {
      grid-column: 3 / 6;
    }

    .return {
      grid-column: 1 / 6;
    }
  }

  .node {
    display: grid;
    align-content: start;
    gap: 2px;
    padding: var(--space-3);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    line-height: 1.45;
    background: var(--color-bg);
    border: var(--border-strong);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }

  .server {
    border-color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .source {
    border-style: dashed;
  }

  .k {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-2xs);
    color: var(--color-accent-ink);
  }

  b {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .arrow {
    align-self: center;
    justify-self: center;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-2xs);
    color: var(--color-muted);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .return {
    padding-top: var(--space-2);
    border-top: 1px dashed var(--color-rule-strong);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    color: var(--color-ink-soft);
  }

  figcaption {
    margin-top: var(--space-2);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }

  figcaption span {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-ink-soft);
  }
</style>
